# Mobile app local development.
#
# Phase 19 audit: the app reads its API base URL from the Expo config
# `extra.apiBaseUrl` field (src/lib/api-base.ts reads
# `Constants.expoConfig.extra.apiBaseUrl`), NOT from an EXPO_PUBLIC_*
# environment variable. The previous `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` entry here was
# not consumed by any code and has been removed.
#
# To point the app at a different API, edit `expo.extra.apiBaseUrl` in
# app.json (development), or override it for a build. Never place secrets
# in app.json or in any EXPO_PUBLIC_* value — these are bundled into the
# shipped application and readable by the device.
#
# See the root .env.example for the API-side configuration.
